1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,263
So never mix them up.

2
00:00:01,263 --> 00:00:04,270
The particle velocity keeps changing.

3
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:07,929
The wave velocity is a fixed property of the medium.

4
00:00:07,929 --> 00:00:18,658
Differentiating with respect to x instead gives the slope of the wave, and the two are linked: particle velocity equals minus v times the slope.

